<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
    <style>
      /* Email styles need to be inline */
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e74c3c 0%, #c0392b 100%); color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
        <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px;">🚨 Event Cancellation</h1>
        <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 16px; opacity: 0.9;"><%= @event.lounge.name %></p>
      </div>
      
      <div style="padding: 30px; background-color: #f8f9fa;">
        <h2 style="color: #333; margin-bottom: 20px;">Important Update, <%= @member.first_name %>!</h2>
        
        <p style="color: #555; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          We regret to inform you that our upcoming event has been cancelled.
        </p>
        
        <div style="background: white; padding: 25px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #e74c3c; margin-bottom: 25px;">
          <h3 style="color: #333; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;"><%= @event.name %></h3>
          <p style="color: #666; margin-bottom: 10px;"><strong>📅 Date:</strong> <%= @event.date.strftime('%A, %B %d, %Y') %></p>
          <p style="color: #666; margin-bottom: 10px;"><strong>⏰ Time:</strong> <%= @event.start_time.strftime('%I:%M %p') %></p>
          <p style="color: #666; margin-bottom: 0;"><strong>📍 Location:</strong> <%= @event.lounge.name %></p>
        </div>
        
        <div style="background: #fef2f2; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
          <h4 style="color: #b91c1c; margin-top: 0;">Cancellation Notice</h4>
          <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">
            Unfortunately, due to unforeseen circumstances, we are unable to proceed with the event as planned.
            We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and appreciate your understanding. 
            We hope to see you at our future events.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <p style="color: #555; line-height: 1.6;">
          If you have any questions, feel free to contact us at <%= @event.lounge.email %> or call us at <%= format_phone_number(@event.lounge.phone_number) %>.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div style="background-color: #333; color: #ccc; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px;">
        <p style="margin: 0;">This notification was sent by <%= @event.lounge.name %></p>
        <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Powered by Herf</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>